/* The map's own strings, in five languages.
 *
 * Loaded only by the map, because the four document pages would otherwise carry
 * forty kilobytes of panel labels they never show. It adds to the same table that
 * i18n.js declares, so T(), Tn() and nf() work here exactly as they do there.
 *
 * A note on the register words. Where a term is the name of a federal register or
 * a statutory term of art — Q347, Datenstand, Restwassermenge, débit résiduel —
 * the translation is the term the register itself uses in that language, not a
 * paraphrase. Where the term is this site's own, it is translated plainly. The
 * distinction matters: a reader who takes a figure from here into a submission
 * needs to be able to find it again in the register it came from.
 */
